# demos layout

- Formal tasks live in `eval/tasks/<tier>-<slug>/` with `task.md` + `eval.md`. `task_id` is that directory name.
- Conversion-quality benchmarks live in `eval/benchmarks/<id>/` (protocol, fixtures, record table). They are not agent tasks.
- Scratch eval artifacts go to `eval/runs/` only — never commit them.
- Curated public results go to `output/<task_id>/<version>/<harness>/` with `meta.json`, `trajectory.jsonl`, `final/`. Keep `aestheticApproval: false` unless a human aesthetic pass says otherwise.
- Replayable project packs: `demos/<slug>/`. Marketing static site: `site/`.
- Never add or restore `examples/` in pixelforge-ai. Large videos stay on the CDN, not this repo.
- Do not leak `eval.md` scoring into the agent-facing prompt; agents get `task.md` only.
- Do not invent pixelforge CLI subcommands; use main-repo agent-skill docs.
